# ThreadSanitizer suppressions.
#
# JUCE frames only. Nothing under dew:: belongs in this file: a race this
# project owns is a bug to fix, and suppressing one here would make the job
# green while leaving it in place.
#
# Add an entry only with a comment saying which JUCE call it is and why it is
# JUCE's to answer for.

# juce::MessageManager and the CoreAudio callback thread exchange ownership
# through Obj-C runtime machinery TSan cannot see into.
called_from_lib:libobjc.A.dylib
